{"seq":2,"slug":"knowledge-distillation","title":"知识蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/model-optimization/knowledge-distillation","wordCount":1614,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识蒸馏\">知识蒸馏</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>知识蒸馏（Knowledge Distillation）是将大模型（教师网络）的知识迁移到小模型（学生网络）的训练技术。其核心思想是教师模型的软标签（Soft Labels）——即输出概率分布——包含了比硬标签更丰富的信息，比如类别之间的相似性关系。学生模型通过学习教师的软标签，可以获得超越直接在硬标签上训练的性能。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入数据] --&gt; B[教师模型]&#10;    A --&gt; C[学生模型]&#10;    B --&gt; D[软标签]&#10;    C --&gt; E[学生输出]&#10;    D --&gt; F[蒸馏损失]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G[硬标签损失]&#10;    F --&gt; H[总损失]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[更新学生参数]\">graph LR\n    A[输入数据] --&gt; B[教师模型]\n    A --&gt; C[学生模型]\n    B --&gt; D[软标签]\n    C --&gt; E[学生输出]\n    D --&gt; F[蒸馏损失]\n    E --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G[硬标签损失]\n    F --&gt; H[总损失]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[更新学生参数]</pre><p>蒸馏的效果取决于教师与学生之间的&quot;知识差距&quot;。差距过大，学生无法有效学习；差距过小，蒸馏收益有限。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>直接训练小模型</th>\n<th>知识蒸馏</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>监督信号</td>\n<td>独热硬标签</td>\n<td>软概率分布 + 硬标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息量</td>\n<td>类别归属</td>\n<td>类别间相似性关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练难度</td>\n<td>高（小模型容量有限）</td>\n<td>低（教师提供更平滑的目标）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛化能力</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>更强（学到了暗知识）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（需运行教师推理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>简单任务</td>\n<td>复杂任务的模型压缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"温度缩放与蒸馏损失\">温度缩放与蒸馏损失</h2><p>Hinton 在 2015 年提出的经典蒸馏框架引入了温度参数 T（Temperature）。标准 Softmax 输出的概率分布通常非常尖锐——最高概率接近 1，其他类别接近 0。提高温度 T 可以使分布更平滑，暴露出类别之间的相对关系（即&quot;暗知识&quot;）。</p>\n<p>蒸馏损失是 KL 散度损失和标准交叉熵损失的加权组合。KL 散度度量学生的软标签分布与教师的软标签分布之间的差异，交叉熵损失确保学生在硬标签上也有合理的表现。温度 T 通常设置为 4-20，α（蒸馏损失权重）设置为 0.5-0.9。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;def distillation_loss(student_logits, teacher_logits, labels, T=4.0, alpha=0.7):&#10;    soft_student = F.log_softmax(student_logits / T, dim=-1)&#10;    soft_teacher = F.softmax(teacher_logits / T, dim=-1)&#10;&#10;    kd_loss = F.kl_div(soft_student, soft_teacher, reduction=&quot;batchmean&quot;) * (T * T)&#10;&#10;    ce_loss = F.cross_entropy(student_logits, labels)&#10;&#10;    return alpha * kd_loss + (1 - alpha) * ce_loss&#10;&#10;class DistillationTrainer:&#10;    def __init__(self, teacher, student, T=4.0, alpha=0.7):&#10;        self.teacher = teacher.eval()&#10;        self.student = student&#10;        self.T = T&#10;        self.alpha = alpha&#10;&#10;    def train_step(self, batch, labels):&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            teacher_logits = self.teacher(batch)&#10;&#10;        student_logits = self.student(batch)&#10;        loss = distillation_loss(&#10;            student_logits, teacher_logits, labels, self.T, self.alpha&#10;        )&#10;        return loss\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distillation_loss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(student_logits, teacher_logits, labels, T</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    soft_student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.log_softmax(student_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    soft_teacher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.softmax(teacher_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    kd_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.kl_div(soft_student, soft_teacher, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batchmean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ce_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(student_logits, labels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kd_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ce_loss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DistillationTrainer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, teacher, student, T</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.teacher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher.eval()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> train_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, batch, labels):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            teacher_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.teacher(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        student_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.student(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distillation_loss(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            student_logits, teacher_logits, labels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.T, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss</span></span></code></pre></div><p>温度的选择对蒸馏效果有显著影响。低温度（T=2-4）保留更多教师的置信度信息，适合教师模型置信度本身有意义的场景。高温度（T=10-20）产生更均匀的分布，适合需要学习类别间精细关系的场景。实践中建议以 T=4 为基线，通过小规模实验调优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"特征层蒸馏\">特征层蒸馏</h2><p>经典蒸馏只在输出层匹配教师和学生的概率分布，但教师模型中间层的特征表示同样包含丰富的知识。特征层蒸馏（Feature-Level Distillation）让学生模型的中间特征层也学习教师对应层的表示。</p>\n<p>FitNets 是最早的特征层蒸馏方法，它选择教师和学生的中间层建立配对关系，通过 MSE 损失最小化对应层特征的差异。由于教师和学生的中间层维度通常不同，需要在学生侧插入一个投影层（Projector）进行维度对齐。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class FeatureDistillationLoss(torch.nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, teacher_dims, student_dims):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.projectors = torch.nn.ModuleList([&#10;            torch.nn.Linear(s_dim, t_dim)&#10;            for t_dim, s_dim in zip(teacher_dims, student_dims)&#10;        ])&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, teacher_features, student_features):&#10;        total_loss = 0&#10;        for proj, t_feat, s_feat in zip(&#10;            self.projectors, teacher_features, student_features&#10;        ):&#10;            projected = proj(s_feat)&#10;            total_loss += F.mse_loss(projected, t_feat.detach())&#10;        return total_loss\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FeatureDistillationLoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">torch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, teacher_dims, student_dims):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projectors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.ModuleList([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            torch.nn.Linear(s_dim, t_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t_dim, s_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teacher_dims, student_dims)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, teacher_features, student_features):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proj, t_feat, s_feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projectors, teacher_features, student_features</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            projected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> proj(s_feat)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            total_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.mse_loss(projected, t_feat.detach())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_loss</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意力迁移（Attention Transfer）是特征层蒸馏的一个变体，它不直接匹配特征值，而是匹配特征图的注意力图（Attention Map）。注意力图定义为特征图沿通道维度的 L2 范数，它编码了&quot;模型关注输入的哪些空间位置&quot;。相比直接匹配特征值，注意力迁移对教师-学生架构差异更鲁棒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;教师网络&quot;&#10;        T1[Layer 3] --&gt; T2[Layer 6] --&gt; T3[Layer 9] --&gt; T4[输出]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;学生网络&quot;&#10;        S1[Layer 1] --&gt; S2[Layer 2] --&gt; S3[Layer 3] --&gt; S4[输出]&#10;    end&#10;    T1 -.-&gt;|特征匹配| S1&#10;    T2 -.-&gt;|特征匹配| S2&#10;    T3 -.-&gt;|特征匹配| S3&#10;    T4 -.-&gt;|输出匹配| S4\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"教师网络\"\n        T1[Layer 3] --&gt; T2[Layer 6] --&gt; T3[Layer 9] --&gt; T4[输出]\n    end\n    subgraph \"学生网络\"\n        S1[Layer 1] --&gt; S2[Layer 2] --&gt; S3[Layer 3] --&gt; S4[输出]\n    end\n    T1 -.-&gt;|特征匹配| S1\n    T2 -.-&gt;|特征匹配| S2\n    T3 -.-&gt;|特征匹配| S3\n    T4 -.-&gt;|输出匹配| S4</pre><h2 id=\"自蒸馏与在线蒸馏\">自蒸馏与在线蒸馏</h2><p>自蒸馏（Self-Distillation）不需要额外的教师模型，而是利用模型自身的知识来提升性能。最简单的自蒸馏方式是用模型在当前 epoch 的预测作为下一 epoch 的软标签。Born-Again Networks 研究发现，通过多代自蒸馏（Generation 1 → Generation 2 → ...），即使架构完全相同，后代模型的性能也可以持续提升。</p>\n<p>在线蒸馏（Online Distillation）让教师和学生同时训练，而非先训练教师再蒸馏学生。Deep Mutual Learning（DML）让两个或多个网络互相学习——每个网络既是教师也是学生。这种方式的优势是不需要预训练大型教师模型，节省了训练时间和计算资源。</p>\n<p>对于大模型场景，TinyLLaMA 和 Phi 系列模型展示了有效的 LLM 蒸馏策略。它们不是从单个教师模型蒸馏，而是使用教师模型生成的高质量训练数据来训练小模型。这种&quot;数据蒸馏&quot;方式绕过了传统蒸馏中软标签计算的高昂成本。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>蒸馏方式</th>\n<th>教师来源</th>\n<th>训练流程</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离线蒸馏</td>\n<td>预训练大模型</td>\n<td>两阶段</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>通用压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在线蒸馏</td>\n<td>同时训练的对等模型</td>\n<td>单阶段</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无预训练教师</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自蒸馏</td>\n<td>模型自身</td>\n<td>多代训练</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>性能提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据蒸馏</td>\n<td>教师生成的数据</td>\n<td>单阶段</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>LLM 场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多教师与任务特定蒸馏\">多教师与任务特定蒸馏</h2><p>多教师蒸馏使用多个不同的教师模型同时指导一个学生模型。每个教师可能在不同方面有专长——一个教师擅长理解文本语义，另一个擅长处理数值推理。学生通过融合多个教师的知识，可以获得超越任何单个教师的综合能力。</p>\n<p>多教师蒸馏的关键设计选择是教师输出的融合策略：简单平均、加权平均（权重可以是静态的或根据教师在特定样本上的置信度动态调整的）、或注意力机制融合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class MultiTeacherDistillation:&#10;    def __init__(self, teachers, student, weights=None):&#10;        self.teachers = [t.eval() for t in teachers]&#10;        self.student = student&#10;        self.weights = weights or [1.0 / len(teachers)] * len(teachers)&#10;&#10;    def compute_loss(self, batch, labels, T=4.0):&#10;        teacher_logits_list = []&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            for teacher in self.teachers:&#10;                teacher_logits_list.append(teacher(batch))&#10;&#10;        student_logits = self.student(batch)&#10;        soft_student = F.log_softmax(student_logits / T, dim=-1)&#10;&#10;        kd_loss = 0&#10;        for w, t_logits in zip(self.weights, teacher_logits_list):&#10;            soft_teacher = F.softmax(t_logits / T, dim=-1)&#10;            kd_loss += w * F.kl_div(soft_student, soft_teacher, reduction=&quot;batchmean&quot;)&#10;&#10;        kd_loss *= T * T&#10;        ce_loss = F.cross_entropy(student_logits, labels)&#10;        return 0.7 * kd_loss + 0.3 * ce_loss\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiTeacherDistillation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, teachers, student, weights</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.teachers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [t.eval() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teachers]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teachers)] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(teachers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> compute_loss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, batch, labels, T</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        teacher_logits_list </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.teachers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                teacher_logits_list.append(teacher(batch))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        student_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.student(batch)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        soft_student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.log_softmax(student_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        kd_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w, t_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.weights, teacher_logits_list):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            soft_teacher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.softmax(t_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            kd_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.kl_div(soft_student, soft_teacher, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batchmean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        kd_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ce_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(student_logits, labels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kd_loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ce_loss</span></span></code></pre></div><p>任务特定蒸馏（Task-Specific Distillation）针对特定下游任务定制蒸馏策略。对于序列标注任务，需要在 Token 级别匹配教师和学生的输出分布。对于生成任务，需要使用序列级蒸馏——让学生模型学习教师生成的完整序列，而非只匹配每个位置的概率分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((知识蒸馏))&#10;    经典框架&#10;      温度缩放&#10;      软标签学习&#10;      KL 散度损失&#10;    进阶技术&#10;      特征层蒸馏&#10;      注意力迁移&#10;      投影层对齐&#10;    训练范式&#10;      离线蒸馏&#10;      在线蒸馏&#10;      自蒸馏&#10;      数据蒸馏&#10;    高级策略&#10;      多教师蒸馏&#10;      任务特定蒸馏&#10;      序列级蒸馏\">mindmap\n  root((知识蒸馏))\n    经典框架\n      温度缩放\n      软标签学习\n      KL 散度损失\n    进阶技术\n      特征层蒸馏\n      注意力迁移\n      投影层对齐\n    训练范式\n      离线蒸馏\n      在线蒸馏\n      自蒸馏\n      数据蒸馏\n    高级策略\n      多教师蒸馏\n      任务特定蒸馏\n      序列级蒸馏</pre><ul>\n<li>知识蒸馏的核心是教师模型的软标签包含了&quot;暗知识&quot;——类别之间的相似性关系</li>\n<li>温度参数控制知识迁移的粒度，特征层蒸馏提供了更丰富的中间层知识</li>\n<li>自蒸馏和在线蒸馏消除了对预训练教师的依赖，降低了蒸馏的整体成本</li>\n<li>大模型场景下数据蒸馏是更实用的方案，通过教师生成训练数据间接迁移知识</li>\n<li>多教师蒸馏可以融合不同专长教师的知识，产出能力更全面的学生模型</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识蒸馏","id":"知识蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"温度缩放与蒸馏损失","id":"温度缩放与蒸馏损失"},{"level":2,"text":"特征层蒸馏","id":"特征层蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"自蒸馏与在线蒸馏","id":"自蒸馏与在线蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"多教师与任务特定蒸馏","id":"多教师与任务特定蒸馏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/model-optimization/model-compression"},"next":{"title":"量化深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/model-optimization/quantization-deep-dive"}}